// Build this file as a Go plugin together with a database/sql ODBC wrapper.
// The wrapper's init function must register driver name "odbc" (or set
// QMIGRATION_GBASE8S_SQL_DRIVER to the registered name).
//
// GBase 8s connectivity itself is provided by the vendor GBase Client-SDK
// ODBC library. The Go wrapper only exposes that ODBC manager through
// database/sql; QMigration owns all migration/catalog/write semantics.
package main

import _ "odbc"

func main() {}
